ecisely calibrated to BDO professional standards, and the automatically updating scoreboards will keep you well informed as to how your game is progressing.\n\nSupports both Left and Right handed playing, just grab the darts with the hand you do not intend to throw with, then take a dart into your other hand and throw.  Games are played from 501.", "short_description": "Fancy popping down the pub and playing a few games of darts?  Well now you can with On the Oche - Pub Darts!  Practice on your own, or invite a friend to join you for a match in this immersive recreation of this wonderful game.\n\nThe experience has been created to the exact specifications of BDO World Darts."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.ardooly.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ardooly", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.ardooly.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3008663349381811"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "3924173311023282", "version": "1.1"}, "id": "465967684424134", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "p